{"kind": "mod", "id": 2159, "name": "IWI Tavor X95/X95-R Rifle", "slug": "iwi-tavor-x95x95-r-rifle", "teaser": "Bringing you new bullpup rifle.", "owner_name": "AmightyTank", "downloads": 4694, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-07T16:59:07.000000Z", "created_at": "2025-05-26T05:41:02.000000Z", "published_at": "2025-05-26T05:41:02.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.11.0", "latest_version": "1.1.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Overview</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Introducing a <strong>new bullpup rifle</strong>, an <strong>authorized rework</strong> of the <strong>IWI X95 Rifle mod</strong> originally posted on sns.oddba.cn.</p>\n<p>This mod introduces two types of X95 rifles:</p>\n<p>- <strong>Tavor X95</strong> (standard)</p>\n<p>- <strong>X95-R</strong> chambered in <strong>5.45x39mm</strong></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/8251-pasted-from-clipboard-png/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/8251-pasted-from-clipboard-png/\" alt=\"8251-pasted-from-clipboard-png\" /></a><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/8252-pasted-from-clipboard-png/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/8252-pasted-from-clipboard-png/\" alt=\"8252-pasted-from-clipboard-png\" /></a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/8253-pasted-from-clipboard-png/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/8253-pasted-from-clipboard-png/\" alt=\"8253-pasted-from-clipboard-png\" /></a></p>\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\n<p>- <strong>Two barrel options</strong> for each caliber.</p>\n<p>- <strong>Two grip variations</strong> for customization.</p>\n<p>- <strong>5.45x39mm version</strong> includes a <strong>30-round magazine</strong> and an <strong>extended 60-round magazine</strong>.</p>\n<p>- <strong>Front side rails</strong> can be accessed by removing the protective panel.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Setup and Usage</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>1. Unzip the downloaded files.</p>\n<p>2. Drop the mod folder in to the spt directory.</p>\n<p>3. Launch the game.</p>\n<p>4. Visit <strong>Mechanic’s shop</strong> or the <strong>Flea Market</strong> to find the rifle and its parts.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Permissions and Legal</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>- <strong>When reuploading or sharing this mod</strong>, please clearly indicate the author or source.</p>\n<p>- <strong>Do not distribute files with the <code>.bundle</code> extension</strong> (or its variants) from this mod without permission.</p>\n<p>- Respect the original creators’ rights:</p>\n<p>- Original mod by <strong>saintdeer from oddba</strong>.</p>\n<p>- Reworked animations and textures by <strong>Massivesoft</strong>.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>- <strong>Original Mod Building:</strong> saintdeer from oddba</p>\n<p>- <strong>Rework (Animations, Textures):</strong> <strong>Massivesoft</strong></p>\n<p>- <strong>Special thanks to:</strong> <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/18902-massivesoft/\" rel=\"noreferrer noo